What Render draws, as a person can read it. A style is written ⟨like this⟩:
⟨1⟩ is the escape sequence ESC [ 1 m, and ⟨0⟩ turns every style off. A space
at the end of a row is written ␠.

=== a new file ===

docs/new.md  new file  +3
1 + # Title
2 +
3 + Some text.

=== a file emptied ===

docs/old.md  emptied  -3
1 - # Title
2 -
3 - Some text.

=== a file deleted ===

docs/old.md  deleted file  -3
1 - # Title
2 -
3 - Some text.

=== no changes ===

docs/same.md  no changes

=== binary content ===

img/logo.png  binary or not UTF-8 text: not shown (5 bytes before, 6 after)

=== line endings changed throughout ===

win/readme.txt  +1 -1
line endings changed: CRLF to LF
1 1   one
2   - two
  2 + 2
3 3   three

=== line endings mixed ===

win/mixed.txt
line endings changed on 1 line
1 1   one
2   - two
  2 + two␍
3 3   three

=== the final newline removed ===

a.txt  +1 -1
newline removed from end of file
1 1   one
2   - two
  2 + 2

=== only spaces changed ===

ws.go  +2 -2
1   - →   x := 1
2   - y := 2
  1 + ····x := 1
  2 + y := 2··

=== what a file must not do to a terminal ===

evil.txt  +1 -1
1   - plain
  1 + ␛[2J␛[31mred␇ <U+202E>gnp.exe z<U+200B>w

=== wide characters at the edge ===

ja.txt  +1 -1
1   - 日本語のテキストを折り返
    ↳ す位置で確認します。絵文
    ↳ 字🎉も👨‍👩‍👧含めます。
  1 + 日本語のテキストを折り返
    ↳ す位置で確認する。絵文字
    ↳ 🎉も👨‍👩‍👧含めます。

